# The title's main menu has VR Options (Rerac-vr's, beside the pause menu's): past the logos to the main menu as
# pointer17.sim goes (the hand off the panel until it is there), the hand on its fourth item, VR Options (canvas y 245
# to 283; New Game, Load Game, Options, VR Options, Exit), the trigger into its page, whose rows the pointer then takes
# ([vr-pointer] the port's page of rows, VR Options: row N).
100 hand_pitch 45
900 a 1
906 a 0
1500 a 1
1506 a 0
1900 shot menu
1920 hand_pitch 1.1
1980 shot on-vr-options
2000 right_trigger 1
2006 right_trigger 0
2300 shot vr-page
2320 hand_pitch 2
2380 shot vr-row
2400 right_trigger 1
2406 right_trigger 0
2460 shot vr-row-stepped
2480 hand_pitch 45
2600 quit 0
